Colon-fence as a block opener in a list item

```
- one
 ::: note
 b
 :::
.
<ul>
  <li>one
::: note
b
:::</li>
</ul>
```

```
- one
  ::: note
  b
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <aside class="admonition note">
      <p>b</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- one
   ::: note
   b
   :::
.
<ul>
  <li>one
::: note
b
:::</li>
</ul>
```
